// # Opm Scripts Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 4 build entry points for opm.
//
// Setup: Each script has a single purpose. They compose: build -> test -> verify -> release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. build.oo — oodac check on each public ANCHOR.oo and cli/main.oo.
//   2. test.oo — oodac check on all 8 break-test drivers in qa/.
//   3. verify.oo — refuse VERSION; assert 10 public subdirs have ANCHOR.oo.
//   4. release.oo — verify + test. Push to main is the release.

import "build.oo";
import "test.oo";
import "verify.oo";
import "release.oo";
